# ---------------------------------------------------------------- bake cache
# The raw downloads. 546 MB of them, and every byte is public and reproducible.
# scripts/bake.py --cache-dir points here by default.
.cache/
*.fetchmeta.json

# Bulk source archives, wherever they land. These are the inputs, never ours.
*.geojson.zip
TF_RGN_ADDRESSES_STAT_SECTORS_*.txt.zip
sh_statbel_statistical_sectors_*.geojson
gtfs_*.zip
openaddress-be*.zip
OFFRES_TOURISTIQUES_CSV.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- bake output
#
# WHAT IS COMMITTED, and why:
#
#   web/data/municipalities.json  565 municipalities, their names in nl/fr/de,
#   web/data/nis_history.json     and the 2024 -> 2025 merger map. Both are
#                                 INPUTS to the bake, not outputs. Rebuilding
#                                 them needs the 212 MB sector GeoJSON, so a
#                                 clone that could not reach Statbel could not
#                                 rebuild them at all.
#   web/data/i18n/*.json          Hand-curated. The English override is the ONLY
#                                 source of English in this app and is never
#                                 generated by anything (CLAUDE.md, CONTRACT 8).
#
# WHAT IS NOT, and why:
#
#   Everything below is 100% derived from the pinned 2025 sources by
#   scripts/bake.py, which is idempotent: identical input gives byte-identical
#   output. Committing 6.6 MB of shards would put a large binary-ish diff in
#   every data refresh for no gain. CI runs the bake and publishes the result.
#
#   Consequence to know about: a fresh clone has NO shards. Run the bake once
#   before serving, or the four bands correctly report that nothing is stored
#   on this device. See README.md.
#
web/data/meta.json
web/data/precache.json
web/data/grid/
web/data/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------- python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# --------------------------------------------------------------------- junk
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# ------------------------------------------------------- local scratch space
# Nothing here is load-bearing; the bake and the tests write their own.
/tmp/
/scratch/
*.log
node_modules/
